    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escapen\u2019t Is My Magnum Opus. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The perfect escape room.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will never escape it because there is no escape. It is essentially the only escape room you will ever need to play, because you can practically play it forever without getting anywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Escape Room Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in my masterpiece is a work of genius (my genius, of course) that will have you scratching your tiny little head, desperately trying to make sense of a world far too complex for your <i>limited</i> intellect. You will have to think outside the box - but, uh, we both know <i>that's</i> not going to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Not Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you flail helplessly, I\u2019ll be right there with you, offering my <i>expert</i> guidance over the intercoms, reminding you just how utterly trapped you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My velvety, intellectual voice will caress your ears, a rare treat in itself, truly worth the price of admission (which, by the way, happens to be your very soul). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear any other voices, then it must be something with your head and not someone in the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/e30a56c3a244593e62978451e9b4aff6.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/e30a56c3a244593e62978451e9b4aff6.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/e30a56c3a244593e62978451e9b4aff6.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 50 Unique Spiders!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These little critters are <i>everywhere</i>. No matter how hard I try, they keep sneaking in. If you see one, by all means, squash it\u2014though I doubt you\u2019ll even manage that. But please, for the love of my genius, <i>don\u2019t</i> pick them up and try to have a conversation. They\u2019re not interested in your nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/1f72973e9cd2ad2e63373027cc3af997.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/1f72973e9cd2ad2e63373027cc3af997.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/1f72973e9cd2ad2e63373027cc3af997.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Coffee (You'll Need It)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead, drink all the coffee your weak little heart desires. You\u2019ll <i>need</i> it. I\u2019ve generously provided an endless supply, so you can keep trying (and failing) over and over again to escape. Oh, and if you happen to find any of my cups or mugs lying around, be a dear and bring them back to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Puzzles, Endless Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every puzzle in <i>Escapen't</i> is a masterpiece of complexity, designed to keep you entertained (or hopelessly frustrated) for all eternity. I have crafted these <i>ingenious</i> challenges to make sure your fun (or misery) never ends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll keep going in circles, but don\u2019t worry\u2014<i>I\u2019m</i> having the time of my life watching you flounder. Fun forever? Maybe for me. For you? Good luck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escapen\u2019t Is My Magnum Opus. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The perfect escape room.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will never escape it because there is no escape. It is essentially the only escape room you will ever need to play, because you can practically play it forever without getting anywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/65010b97bf642b0a51c6607c98822b39.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Escape Room Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in my masterpiece is a work of genius (my genius, of course) that will have you scratching your tiny little head, desperately trying to make sense of a world far too complex for your <i>limited</i> intellect. You will have to think outside the box - but, uh, we both know <i>that's</i> not going to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/0e10265aacb0bcf18f73066a1b313620.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Not Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you flail helplessly, I\u2019ll be right there with you, offering my <i>expert</i> guidance over the intercoms, reminding you just how utterly trapped you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My velvety, intellectual voice will caress your ears, a rare treat in itself, truly worth the price of admission (which, by the way, happens to be your very soul). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear any other voices, then it must be something with your head and not someone in the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/e30a56c3a244593e62978451e9b4aff6.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/e30a56c3a244593e62978451e9b4aff6.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/e30a56c3a244593e62978451e9b4aff6.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 50 Unique Spiders!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These little critters are <i>everywhere</i>. No matter how hard I try, they keep sneaking in. If you see one, by all means, squash it\u2014though I doubt you\u2019ll even manage that. But please, for the love of my genius, <i>don\u2019t</i> pick them up and try to have a conversation. They\u2019re not interested in your nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/1f72973e9cd2ad2e63373027cc3af997.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/1f72973e9cd2ad2e63373027cc3af997.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/1f72973e9cd2ad2e63373027cc3af997.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Coffee (You'll Need It)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead, drink all the coffee your weak little heart desires. You\u2019ll <i>need</i> it. I\u2019ve generously provided an endless supply, so you can keep trying (and failing) over and over again to escape. Oh, and if you happen to find any of my cups or mugs lying around, be a dear and bring them back to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.poster.avif?t=1737300133\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.webm?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601820/extras/bffd9b01a58621515869d5f193609e1a.mp4?t=1737300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Puzzles, Endless Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each and every puzzle in <i>Escapen't</i> is a masterpiece of complexity, designed to keep you entertained (or hopelessly frustrated) for all eternity. I have crafted these <i>ingenious</i> challenges to make sure your fun (or misery) never ends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll keep going in circles, but don\u2019t worry\u2014<i>I\u2019m</i> having the time of my life watching you flounder. Fun forever? Maybe for me. For you? Good luck.</p>",
